/**
 * Load test for: POST /api/ai/saveRecording
 * External video file used > backend->src->tests-InterviewScheduleError.js->recordings->testVideo.webm
 * Fixes OOM:
 * - Reads ONE file once
 * - Builds ONE base64 data URI once (when useSingleFile=true)
 * - Does NOT prebuild payload arrays of size total
 * - Sends requests in batches
 *
 * Adds:
 * - Warmup requests (not counted in stats)
 * - Optional sleep between batches
 * - Resource logging (process + system memory + approx process CPU)
 * - More stable variance check for small samples (auto bumps tolerance to 50% if total < 20)
 */

